p=r/'docs/MissionRules/README.md';s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('Before every random leaf in a condition tree has received its first result, that tree cannot pass, including under None or Any. Different intervals keep their own schedules and combine their latest results after initialization.', 'Before its first roll, each random condition is false. Groups apply ordinary logic: Any may pass through another true child, and None may pass while the random answer is false. There is no hidden random requirement overriding an enclosing group. Different intervals keep their own schedules and combine their latest results.');s=s.replace('- A result is held until the next scheduled roll.', '- **Roll Behavior**: Keep rolling (default) makes a new roll each interval. Roll once makes exactly one roll after the first interval and holds that first result for this Match, including a failed roll. It does not keep trying until success. Event Once/Every time controls action execution independently.\n- A result is held until the next scheduled roll (or until Match ends for Roll once).');s=s.replace('Leaving Match clears held results and cancels pending events that depend on them.', 'Leaving Match resets random answers to false and stops their rolls; pending actions are rechecked with normal group logic and existing phase-lifetime rules.');p.write_text(s)
